`src/topography/` reimplements in TypeScript the scalp field interpolation MNE-Python performs in
`mne.channels.interpolation._make_interpolation_matrix` and `mne.forward._field_interpolation._make_surface_mapping`.
The generated assets under `src/config/topography/` are produced by calling MNE-Python from `tools/topography/`, and
the electrode position table is derived from the `standard_1005` montage distributed with it.

